import Hilbert14.Lemmas.ObstructionCoefficient

/-!
# The obstruction to finite generation

After reduction modulo y⁴, scalar-plus-nilpotent elements are integral over
the base field. A finitely generated algebra of such elements would be a finite
module, giving a uniform bound on polynomial coefficient support. The family
with fixed B³ coefficient contradicts this bound because B³ survives modulo y⁴.
-/
